1 Algo execution plan on June 5 for 100 credits with an expiry of July 3 (28 days), and on June 18 you want to upgrade your execution plan to 2, you would only need to pay 50 credits (for 14 days), and the expiry date will be adjusted to align with the current plan expiry of July 3."})]})},{title:"What should be my Algo execution plan if I deploy different numbers of strategies on different days?",desc:(0,a.jsxs)("div",{children:[(0,a.jsx)("p",{children:"You should purchase for the max number of strategies you want to run on any trading day."}),(0,a.jsx)("p",{children:"Let's say you want to run 6 strategies on Wednesday and 4 strategies on all the other days of the week. You will need 600 credits to activate all your strategies, as the plan must cover the maximum number of strategies running on any given day."})]})},{title:"Can I deploy different strategies for different days with the same Algo execution plan?",desc:"You can deploy different strategies on different days of the week using the same plan."},{title:"If any of my strategies is stopped/squared off can I deploy any other strategy under the same plan?",desc:(0,a.jsxs)("div",{children:[(0,a.jsx)("p",{children:'Yes, you can switch strategies after deployment. Only "Running" strategies count towards your daily Algo execution plan limit.'}),(0,a.jsx)("p",{children:'If the status is anything other than "Running" (e.g., "Squared off," "Manual," or “Error”), you can replace it with another strategy from "Deployable Strategies."'})]})},{title:"I have credits in my account so why did I get an email saying my plan will expire soon?",desc:" The mail you got is regarding expiry of your subscription plan that you purchase for a month using credits. Your credits will not expire and you can use them to renew the plan again."},{title:"Can I renew the execution plan before expiry?",desc:"Yes, you will receive a renewal option 7 days before your plan expires. You can click on the renew button on your profile page to automati